# --- Secrets (S5: no credentials in Git, images, or logs) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- Build / deps ---
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Runtime / local ---
logs/
*.log
backups/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Internal documents (this repository is PUBLIC) ---------------------
# The design documents carry an "Internal - IT Confidential" marking, and the
# deployment runbook is an operational map of a live host: public IP, SSH port,
# security-group layout and the kill-switch procedure. Neither belongs in a public
# repository. They stay on disk, untracked; keep them in a private repo or the
# document store instead.
docs/*.docx
docs/MCP_Gateway_Phase1_Review.md
docs/MCP_Gateway_Phase1_Implementation_Guide.md
deploy/RUNBOOK.md

# Keep the explanatory note that replaces them.
!docs/README.md
